  "title": {
    "zh": "升级集群实例组件",
    "en": "UpgradeClusterAddons"
  },
  "descriptions": {
    "zh": "- 单用户调用频率： 10次/秒。\n- 创建集群是一个异步的操作，调用接口返回之后，需要等待10~20分钟不等，等待集群初始化完成。这个过程中可以调用DescribeClustersV1接口查询集群创建状态。集群创建成功之后，可以调用DescribeClusterUserKubeconfig获取集群证书。",
    "en": "- Each user can call this operation up to 10 times per second.\n\n- Creating a cluster is an asynchronous operation. After calling the operation, wait 10 to 20 minutes for the cluster to initialize. During this time, you can call the DescribeClustersV1 operation to query the cluster creation status. After the cluster is created, call the DescribeClusterUserKubeconfig operation to obtain the cluster certificate."
  },
  "example": {
    "unifiedCli": "aliyun ens upgrade-cluster-addons --cluster-id eck-xxxxxxxxx --addons '[{\"NextVersion\":\"v2\",\"ConfigSchema\":[{\"AppVersion\":\"4155709cd12a09bdb8cbaca71bf03233\",\"ConfigVersion\":\"4155709cd12a09bdb8cbaca71bf03233\",\"Params\":{\"k1\":\"v1\"},\"Name\":\"edge-csi-lite\"}],\"Name\":\"edge-csi-lite\"}]' --region cn-hangzhou",
    "legacyCli": "aliyun ens UpgradeClusterAddons --region cn-hangzhou --ClusterId 'eck-xxxxxxxxx' --Addons '[{\"NextVersion\":\"v2\",\"ConfigSchema\":[{\"AppVersion\":\"4155709cd12a09bdb8cbaca71bf03233\",\"ConfigVersion\":\"4155709cd12a09bdb8cbaca71bf03233\",\"Params\":{\"k1\":\"v1\"},\"Name\":\"edge-csi-lite\"}],\"Name\":\"edge-csi-lite\"}]'"
  }
